    native_struct_i64_field_ctor_reads_wrong_value_2026-11-05, 0, "re-verified no-repro 2026-11-12 on aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu: Stage 2 pure-Simple compiler (bootstrap-fable-12, release/1.0.0 tip 7170302b8c9) native-build test/s3sanity/w4_struct.spl --backend=cranelift (core-c-bootstrap runtime bundle) builds rc=0 and prints PASS w4_struct rc=0; objdump shows mov x26,#7 / rt_alloc(8) / str at base / orr #1 tag / and #-8 / ldr / cmp #7 - construct and field read are correct; repro file now tracked at test/s3sanity/w4_struct.spl. Legacy bug_db.sdn:4281 still reads open only because that file is frozen (shard replaces it)."

    native_struct_i64_field_ctor_reads_wrong_value_2026-11-05, 1, "re-verified no-repro 2026-11-12 on aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu with the bootstrap-fable-13 Stage 2 producer (pinned source f8ad54b28467, sha256 2fb9ecacbf41145f51aff32104978b39485ada4a07d06c8109c38c030a8a340c; the stage3/stage2-admitted copy is byte-identical): native-build --threads 1 of test/s3sanity/w4_struct.spl prints PASS w4_struct rc=0 on --backend=cranelift and --backend=llvm; the negative-case fixture test/fixtures/compiler/struct_i64_field_ctor_native.spl (multi-field incl -5 and i64::MAX, out-of-order named args, f64/text/bool, nested struct, ctor from local) prints a=7 m=-5,9223372036854775807,42 o=1,2,3 f=2.5 t=hi b=true n=11,22 v=13 / PASS rc=0 on both backends. Stage 3 NOT verified: no Stage 3 compiler binary exists on this host (every bootstrap-fable-*/stage3 dir holds only stage2-admitted/stage2-runtime-authority copies); Stage 3-as-producer check deferred to run 14. MIR pin: test/01_unit/compiler/50.mir/struct_i64_field_ctor_spec.spl 5/5 on seed sha256 56834dffffd8cd8975e93dbd85c263d2f56e4c47e89a42698ac3278badccb3b4 (Aggregate(Struct) operands in declared order, GetField declared slot)."
